notes: |
  Advisory (off-slide, for the metadata-integration workstream — not shown on slide):
  1. Compliance depth: draft covers classification + certified uses but not retention rules / regulatory tags. Proposed: capture at Stage 1, enforce at Stage 6.
  2. Reference data & units of measure: not staged in the draft; owner unassigned — decision needed. Proposed: Stage 1/3 as governed domain concepts.
  3. Social / usage metadata (popularity, access frequency, consuming reports): emerging fifth category; the signal AI agents use for asset recommendation. Proposed: Stage 7 → Purview.
  4. AI-readiness metadata: the data-contract standard has moved two major versions past what the draft cites (2.1.0); agent-oriented ports are now defined by the standard. Proposed: Stage 6 + 7.
